      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BILAMBIL BEACH (3) doesn't show much early dash but winds into his races, two back missing the frame but last time hitting the line hard to place when third (20.50) in a Grade 5 at this track last time. Solid record here including three wins. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Can find winning form. NUGGET ROBERTS (2) has mixed form recently, finishing seventh (20.55) in a Grade 4/5 at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Safe beginner and drawn well close to the inside. Well placed here and can atone this time. COSMIC CASPER (1) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing sixth (20.82) at this track in a Grade 5. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the rails draw. Well placed here and should do much better. TWO FISTED (5) has strong claims after a top-three finish last time out.",
